{"parse": {"title": "打虎记-05", "pageid": 134669, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%89%93%E8%99%8E%E8%AE%B0-04\" title=\"打虎记-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">打虎记-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%89%93%E8%99%8E%E8%AE%B0-06\" title=\"打虎记-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">打虎记</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.A3.9E.E8.8D.89\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"飞草\">飞草</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 飞草</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Flying Leaves</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>骨梭子……我记得是你父亲之前认识的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>是。衙门审讯得知，她就是那晚劫掠祝县的主谋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>那晚的盗匪都被处决，唯有她带着几个人逃脱，在水乡附近失了踪迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>过去这么多年，若她还活着，想必会放松警惕，过上平常的生活。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>巡检有个空缺。若我能解决这件事，便有了能填缺的功劳。得了赏钱，也可贴补家用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>如此，你终于也有了功名，不必给那些人欺负……咳咳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>我不熟他那些狐朋狗友。但你父亲提过，她实力强劲，是个可靠的朋友，也是难缠的对手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我会小心。何况，母亲传我的刀法在涣州府本就鲜有敌手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>哈哈……这话我爱听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-647401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>但我只担心你太过勉强自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光从墙上取下长刀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>不必担心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>这正是我一直追求的道路，也是唯一正确的道路。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小路的尽头是一片山林间的空地。程和光站在树下，抬头仰望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>这便是你所说的决斗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中跷脚坐在一根极高的树枝上，好整以暇地转着手里的骨梭子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>年轻时，我就是这么遛官兵的。你总不能要求敌人按照你熟悉的方式战斗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光抽刀出鞘，猛然横劈高树的枝干。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>这是他们用过的办法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一根银线从摇晃的枝叶间吐出，将秀郎中安然无恙地荡到另一棵树的高处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>而且失败了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光凝视着那段高枝，操控几枚树叶向上刺去。只是它们未及高度，便已唰唰掉落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>别白费力气了！我知道你的神秘术够不着这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>那便逼你到我能够着的高度！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>长刀在他手里旋风似的劈砍，霎时间便引得周围的松木激荡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几次来回，秀郎中不禁叹了口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>唉，小子愚钝！这样又有什么用？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>我这线可是能伸半里地——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一根更长的银线，连向更远的树木。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-647204.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647204.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647204.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-647204.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647204.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-647204.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647204.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>银线本应如她所料将她收往高处，却中途崩断，把她甩落在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>空中两枚铁叶随之落下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>做得不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>你在树间摇荡时，会下落一段距离……下落的多少取决于银线的长度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>只要你用的银线够长，我的神秘术便能够到你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光将刀压在身前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>现在打吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中已经背过身去，慢悠悠走上了回程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>不，我累了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光无可奈何，只得跟上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>你怎可如此耍赖？！若是不想对决，何必主动约战，诳我来此？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>急什么！你还不一定能赢我呢！有个词叫“韬光养晦”，你懂不懂？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>若你赢了，要做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>带你去衙门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>赢的那天就去？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……不，等到医馆里的病人都痊愈了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>那你可指望错了！这水乡一千多人，医馆三天两头有人光顾，可没有清闲的时候！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647203.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647203.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/HeadIconSmall-647203.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>何况，医馆现在不还有两个病人吗？那又何必着急？明日再打下一段吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:222%\">翌日</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3b/Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>落叶纷纷化为利刃，与银线缠在一处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>二者速度极快，化作空中一道道难以辨识的残影。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>你进步很快。一般人可没法全接下我的招式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>还不够快。我抓不住银线的气……没法把它变成金属。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>骨梭子被你握在手中保护，气的阻滞很强……“锐意”亦不能使用。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b6/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>要是让你这么快就废了我的武器，我的名声还要不要了？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\"><img alt=\"linzhongshenchu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/600px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/900px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongshenchu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\"><img alt=\"linzhongxiuqichu_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/600px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/900px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-linzhongxiuqichu_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几道黑色的银线缠住了锋利的刀锋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>神秘术也不是次次好用的，对吧？你无法解除金属化，反而束缚了自己的刀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光脖颈上的银线骤然收紧。与此同时，秀郎中脚下的野草倒飞上刺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>草叶急停在了她的喉间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>能同时控制这么多……倒是小瞧你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>呃……平了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>今天就这样吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_5_bg_liangjiacitang1\"><img alt=\"2_5_bg_liangjiacitang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang1.png/600px-Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang1.png/900px-Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ca/Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang1.png/1200px-Cg-2_5_bg_liangjiacitang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光在林地里练了些时候，迟了一步返回医馆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几位乡民正扶着那猎户离开。猎户看见他，朝他招了招手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">猎户：</div><div>我没什么大事了，回家了！秀郎中事务繁忙，不好总是留在这里麻烦她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/HeadIconSmall-623402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">猎户：</div><div>我知道你把那老虎杀了，怎么不早告诉我！我这就回乡里和大家伙说声！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>举手之劳，不必如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方却全不听他讲话，傻乐着走远了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_4_bg_05\"><img alt=\"3_4_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/Cg-3_4_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-3_4_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光走回医馆，看见秀郎中正坐在药炉边扇风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伙计几天前被秀郎中赶去胡家做熬药师傅，如今医馆里只剩他们两人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……你既然有如此医术，为什么要去做盗匪？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>因为我想做英雄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>大义需在正道上实现。盗匪纵使有劫富济贫之举，也难免会伤害无辜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>与你这正经人说不通。像神仙一样往贫民房子里撒粮，那才叫畅快！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……劫掠祝县百姓，也是英雄之举吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中一心盯着药炉，似乎没有注意程和光说话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻后，她才做了回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>不是。所以我知道自己当不成英雄。在这做个人人尊敬的郎中，可是轻松多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>你父亲在那件事之后如何了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>你不知道？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>抱歉，我跑得太快，急着当神仙呐，哈哈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她自嘲似的笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>之后，我住在青瓦白墙里面，柴米油盐，布帛菽粟，天天听乡民病人的八卦。其他的一律不知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我说过他去世了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>所以自然是和其他人一样……认罪伏法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>……所以是因为这件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>秀郎中提起药炉的盖子，向内看了一眼，整个医馆瞬间溢满了草药的苦香。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……乡民都夸你的医术不错，你对痨病可有研究，可有什么灵丹妙药之类？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>什么症状，多久了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>前年腊月开始的，最初也只是些咳嗽、盗汗之类，之后咳得愈发严重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>近三个月，唾血频繁，胸痛剧烈，常说喘不上气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>……治不了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>祝县的大夫也这么说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>他们说的没错。恐怕难过今年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>是你什么人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>程和光没有回答，转身走出了医馆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>过了半晌，药炉冒泡了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>程和光，帮我把勺子飞过来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>程和光！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毫无应答。秀郎中终于肯放开药炉，起身走出门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_dong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>医馆外原本是一块草地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>此刻，所有被割裂的草叶都化为利器，在风中成团地狂舞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>细针们在风中穿梭，撞出铿锵的金石声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-313721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-313721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-313721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>这不公平。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>呵……花开花落，草枯草荣，总赖东君主。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313720.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313720.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/HeadIconSmall-313720.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313720.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>……你竟会说这种话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>哈哈，我也是医学世家出身，也读过几本话本，略识几个字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"647201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"647201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-647201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-647201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>你不喜欢这种话？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有细密如针的金属瞬时停滞在空中，而后散落一地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我会打扫收拾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>你在我这耽搁太久了，该回家了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">程和光：</div><div>我的事还没做完。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">秀郎中：</div><div>明日会做完的。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "打虎记-05"}}